@SmartTask.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047
# Replace taskId with the ID returned by Create a task.
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List tasks
GET {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Clean Architecture",
  "description": "Build and test the Task API."
}

### Get a task
GET {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Replace a task
PUT {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Clean Architecture",
  "description": "Completed the workshop.",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Validation error (400)
POST {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": " "
}

### Missing task (404)
GET {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### OpenAPI document (development only)
GET {{SmartTask.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
